WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.359
- Siri is a device on
my phone that activates

00:00:02.359 --> 00:00:04.166
all the time and I don't want it to.

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:10.282
- I don't have Siri
because I have an iPhone 4.

00:00:10.282 --> 00:00:11.715
- Me and Siri have never met.

00:00:11.715 --> 00:00:14.223
- Siri and I just started
hanging out like a week ago,

00:00:14.223 --> 00:00:16.771
and she's the best.

00:00:16.771 --> 00:00:17.979
- How do I even do it?

00:00:17.979 --> 00:00:19.472
I just hold it down?

00:00:21.075 --> 00:00:23.013
- [Woman] What is zero divided by zero?

00:00:23.013 --> 00:00:25.183
- [Voiceover] Imagine
that you have zero cookies

00:00:25.183 --> 00:00:27.411
and you split them evenly
among zero friends,

00:00:27.411 --> 00:00:29.527
how many cookies does each person get?

00:00:29.527 --> 00:00:31.359
See it doesn't make sense,

00:00:31.359 --> 00:00:34.195
and Cookie Monster is sad
that there are no cookies,

00:00:34.195 --> 00:00:36.812
and you are sad that you have no friends.

00:00:37.844 --> 00:00:39.657
- (bleep) you Siri!

00:00:39.657 --> 00:00:41.780
- That's pretty good.
That's pretty clever.

00:00:42.043 --> 00:00:44.148
- [Woman] Why are fire trucks red?

00:00:45.217 --> 00:00:46.220
What?

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:48.170
- Because they have eight
wheels and four people on them

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:49.982
and four plus eight is 12.

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:51.630
- And there are 12 inches in a foot,

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:54.418
and one foot is a ruler, and
Queen Elizabeth was a ruler,

00:00:54.418 --> 00:00:56.346
and Queen Elizabeth was also a ship.

00:00:56.346 --> 00:00:58.342
- Siri is messing with me.

00:00:58.342 --> 00:00:59.758
- And the ship sailed the seas,

00:00:59.758 --> 00:01:02.226
and in the seas are
fish, and fish have fins.

00:01:02.226 --> 00:01:03.962
- The Finns fought the Russians.

00:01:03.962 --> 00:01:05.006
- And the Russians are red

00:01:05.006 --> 00:01:07.392
and fire trucks are
always "russian" around.

00:01:07.397 --> 00:01:08.996
Oh my god!

00:01:08.996 --> 00:01:10.973
- I feel like this is
some sort of cruel trick.

00:01:10.973 --> 00:01:13.225
- That was like a really long dad joke.

00:01:14.135 --> 00:01:15.849
- [Man] Does Santa Claus exist?

00:01:15.849 --> 00:01:17.425
- [Voiceover] Let's just
say I'm not the only one

00:01:17.425 --> 00:01:19.857
who knows if you've been good or bad.

00:01:20.865 --> 00:01:22.605
I'm going to pretend you didn't ask that.

00:01:22.605 --> 00:01:24.857
I don't want you to get
a lump of coal this year.

00:01:24.857 --> 00:01:26.969
- See look she's not even sassing me,

00:01:26.969 --> 00:01:28.665
she's just looking out for me.

00:01:28.665 --> 00:01:31.113
- [Voiceover] Well those
cookies don't eat themselves.

00:01:33.483 --> 00:01:34.743
- Oh!

00:01:35.585 --> 00:01:37.093
- [Woman] What does the fox say?

00:01:38.193 --> 00:01:40.020
- [Voiceover] Wa-pa-pa-pa-pa-pa-pow!

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:44.085
- (laughs) I'd take
Siri to karaoke with me.

00:01:44.085 --> 00:01:45.269
- I saw that video and I was like,

00:01:45.269 --> 00:01:47.656
this is the only thing
I've ever found funny.

00:01:47.656 --> 00:01:49.448
- She's got spunk. She's got character.

00:01:49.448 --> 00:01:51.628
- Is it weird to say that I
liked it when she sassed me?

00:01:51.628 --> 00:01:53.393
- I don't like to be sassed by my friends.

00:01:53.393 --> 00:01:55.136
I don't need to be sassed by my phone.

00:01:55.136 --> 00:01:57.108
- Will you marry me?

00:01:57.108 --> 00:01:59.152
- [Voiceover] My end
user licensing agreement

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:01.752
does not cover marriage, my apologies.

00:02:02.962 --> 00:02:04.752
- That makes me sad.

00:02:05.642 --> 00:02:07.200
- [Voiceover] I'm sorry.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.806
- She's cold.

